rés du Centre, les Degrés du Patec, le square Jean Aicard et les majestueux Degrés de la Mer.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg/960px-Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Magdalena Starowieyska, Dariusz Golik, CC BY-SA 3.0 pl","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-cb976930-b1c9-3916-9bba-bcf97927730d","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"lcv","category":"À voir","title":"La chapelle Sainte Magdeleine","date":null,"time":"","place":"La Môle, La Môle","lat":43.22594,"lng":6.47276,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791168335537,"description":"Sentier de La Sainte Magdeleine : à ne pas manquer.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2d/Abbaye_Fontenay_eglise_facade.jpg/960px-Abbaye_Fontenay_eglise_facade.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Myrabella, CC BY-SA 4.0","photoGeneric":true}]